{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20264AWCOSwCn01795186948.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>國際法院裁定緬甸對羅興亞人實行種族滅絕，罪名成立，緬甸指裁決不公平。</p><p></p><p>聯合國最高司法機構荷蘭海牙的國際法院，周四就緬甸軍方在2017年屠殺羅興亞人案作出裁決。由15人組成的法官小組，以9比6裁定，緬甸清剿羅興亞人構成種族滅絕，違反《防止及懲治滅絕種族罪公約》，且不接受上訴。是國際法院成立逾80年來，首次裁定有主權國干犯相關罪行。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.ICJ.MYANMAR-2300.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026YAkvU7FQkx1795187558.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>緬甸外交部表示深感失望，指其採取的是反恐行動，並無滅絕種族的意圖，又指裁決並非一致通過。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.ICJ.MYANMAR-2300_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20265BRzsouYB81795187580.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>在北京，外交部稱中方對越權管轄和擴大解釋等問題存在關切，認為有關做法不利於爭端解決。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T17:24:32.888846+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":253,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T14:32:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T09:57:11.491762+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T17:17:45.012276+00:00","content_hash":"31320f9dff2f714a941bd1a0e8d539fae94af78d77307c0833116d832415d646","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-20T17:24:32.888846+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}